ind":"update","title":"Update 2.4 — Two New Languages, New Music, and a CHF Lesson","summary":"A small but noticeable demo update.Six languages. Traditional Chinese (繁體中文) and Spanish (Español) join Russian, English, Simplified Chinese and Japanese. Pick your language on the start screen, or change it in the settings at any time.New music. A new track called GRACE now plays on the main screen and in game, and it’s on by default. BadGafi is still here — switch between them from the main menu or the settings, and your choice is remembered.A new tutorial lesson. Clippo now explains CHF, the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T19:18:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942081","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1845383656377905","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"update","title":"Demo 2.3 update: new tutorial mode, balance changes and more!","summary":"Hi everyone!Demo 2.3 is out now on Windows and Mac! It's not as big as 2.0 and 2.2, but it still changes how the game plays. Here's what's inside:■ 1. NEW TUTORIAL MODEIf you tried the game before and dropped it because things were confusing, now's a great time to give it another shot!Meet Clippo. Yes, I drew him myself. Why not?!The main screen now has a big TUTORIAL button (and just below it there's a link to the Steam guides).- It's a sandbox where you can't lose- The tutorial takes up to 20 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T14:55:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1844751498218438","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"A tiny guide for Spin Cycle!","summary":"Hey!I know how many problems people run into with figuring out where to even start and how to get a grip on the game!While I'm working on a new tutorial, I've written a general guide to the game: what it's about and what to do at the very start.It may not be interactive enough, but I hope it'll be useful to at least someone!ːsteamsaltyː:https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199837102288/myworkshopfiles/?appid=4689930§ion=guides— BadGafi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T13:38:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1844115010495171","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.2 is out!","summary":"Hey!A fairly big update is waiting for you: lots of fixes based on player feedback, plus brand new mechanics.But first, thank you for playing, for the feedback and for helping to build this game! We're already at almost 600 wishlists and almost 400 people who played the demo!A small request: if you enjoyed the demo, please leave a review on the demo's Steam page. The game will take part in the autumn Steam Next Fest, and reviews genuinely help developers (10+ Steam reviews push a game into recom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T15:17:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495171","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1843481262701893","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Leave your feedback on Demo 2.0 / 2.1!","summary":"Hey!I'd like to ask for your feedback on the latest demo versions 2.0 / 2.1 once again. If you played and it's not too much trouble — share your experience here or drop me an email at badgafigames@gmail.comAnd thanks for playing!— BadGafi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T14:46:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1842846814451459","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.1 is out!","summary":"Hi!The demo has been updated and is available on Windows and Mac. Not a huge list of changes, but the ones that are there matter.New: limit ordersA regular exchange works the simple way: you buy at the price currently on the board. A limit order means something else, namely \"buy when the price gets down to here\". You leave a note for the market and go do other things.You spot a war warning in the Summary, so you place a DARKCOIN buy below market ahead of time. If the panic pushes the rate throug","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T18:29:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1842212951298094","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.0 is live! What's inside?","summary":"Hey!First of all, I want to say thanks to everyone who's added the game to their Wishlist and played the demo (there are already over 500 and 300 of you respectively!). And special thanks to those who left feedback (even the negative ones, heh).If you run into any issues or want to give me advice, please post in the Steam threads.I quite often make changes based on your suggestions! Especially since Steam Next Fest is coming up, and my demo is participating!So, Demo 2.0 is now available to downl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T20:31:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1836506165568477","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1 is live!","summary":"Hey!I'm reading your feedback (there are already almost 150 of you who've played — super cool!) and decided to push a batch of simple updates:🍎 Mac demo・For me this is big news, but I have no idea what else to add here…📚 A proper tutorial (well, compared to the old one)・When you click the button in the first email from your boss, a mode with more detailed explanations of where to click and what to do will activate. ・It doesn't last long, but it walks you through your first steps in the role and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T16:11:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1836506165554474","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"I need your feedback!","summary":"Hey!100 people have already played the Spin Cycle demo.That's a pretty big deal (by my standards).If you played it — whether you liked it or didn't - please leave your feedback! You can do it either on the demo's page directly, or right here in the comments under this post.It's genuinely important for me to get this feedback - both for fixing the demo and for the development going forward.- BadGafi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T16:01:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1835871199315039","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.0 is now live!","summary":"Hey everyone!The demo of Spin Cycle is now available.Here's what's in it:・Goal — earn $10 million, starting with $1 million + a stash of starter coins ・5 currencies in the demo: 2 fiat and 3 coins ・3 syndicates, 3 major events, and 3 minor events ・13 countries and territories: 12 standard ones + 1 unrecognized republic with its own quirks ・13 perks ・Core mechanics: Operations and route building, the Exchange, and more ・Simple mail-based questsLink: Please play it, add to your Wishlist, and repor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T09:21:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315039","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689930-1835236783572137","game_id":"steam-4689930","kind":"announcement","title":"SPIN CYCLE — first gameplay video!","summary":"Hey everyone!Honestly, I'm surprised and genuinely touched that there are already over 300 of you — people who've added the game to their Wishlist! For me, pre-release, that's a really meaningful number. Thank you for getting interested in the project!This game is an economic strategy about an accountant for the criminal underworld. You help various clans move money between countries, earn from crypto and stocks, and… get into trouble along the way.The demo will launch in July. I've put together","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T20:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783572137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source